{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:06.12] Late night, with the—\n[00:09.20] Late night, with the boys in a foreign\n[00:11.80] Yeah, uh-huh\n[Chorus]\n[00:12.24] Late night, with the boys in a foreign (Skrrt, skrrt)\n[00:14.64] Pick the hoes up and kick 'em out in the mornin' (Yes, sir)\n[00:17.40] Uh, even brought a ho home for my girlfriend (Yes, sir)\n[00:20.18] She gave us both sloppy top, it was amazin' (Ugh, yeah-yeah)\n[00:23.18] Pray to God, used to conversate with Satan (Uh, oh)\n[00:25.70] Lost in confusion, I'll show you what a maze is (Oh, oh)\n[00:28.56] My mind is a palace, don't got the blueprints (Oh, oh)\n[00:31.60] Told them demons I got a new phone, uh, who is this? (Oh)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:34.34] Yeah, I'm global, yeah, a mogul\n[00:37.14] Yeah, I'm loco, Perc', no coco\n[00:39.94] Fans on my nerves ask for photos\n[00:42.90] In the airport rushin' to a flight, I was late for\n[00:45.78] All of this a blеssing though, to God I'm thankful\n[00:48.60] All these drugs got me feeling likе Allah, but I'm not close\n[00:51.54] I remember a couple winters ago, the day's cold\n[00:54.24] Doing drive-bys, grrah, grrah, out the window\n[00:57.22] On my knees, my hands fold\n[01:00.00] Praying for some sanity, lost soul\n[01:02.86] Wondering why my head's so gone\n[01:05.70] Paranoid, so I got to keep a pole\n[01:08.54] Fall to my knees, hands full\n[01:11.42] Crying from insanity, lost soul\n[01:14.30] Will I find some inner peace\n[01:15.88] ? I don't know\n[01:16.98] Until then, I'm numbing my thoughts, all wrong\n[Chorus]\n[01:20.72] Late night, with the boys in a foreign (Skrrt, skrrt)\n[01:23.20] Pick the hoes up and kick 'em out in the mornin' (Yes, sir)\n[01:25.92] Uh, even brought a ho home for my girlfriend (Yes, sir)\n[01:28.74] She gave us both sloppy top, it was amazin' (Ugh, yeah-yeah)\n[01:31.76] Pray to God, used to conversate with Satan (Uh, oh)\n[01:34.44] Lost in confusion, I'll show you what a maze is (Oh, oh)\n[01:37.14] My mind is a palace, don't got the blueprints (Oh-oh)\n[01:40.16] Told them demons I got a new phone, uh, who is this? (Oh)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:42.92] I got with a girl that help me get the picture, panoramic\n[01:45.70] She told me that everything gon' be okay, I shouldn't panic\n[01:48.58] Proceeded to do her wrong anyway, typical man\n[01:51.50] I apologize for my mistakes, they won't happen again\n[01:54.68] All these other hoes, unimportant, irrelevant\n[01:57.46] I ain't tryna remind you of that dude that's in your past\n[02:00.38] Also, I'm saying I'm sorry on behalf of my ex\n[02:03.22] She gon' learn her lesson when she spend eternity in Hell\n[02:06.10] You the greatest thing that happened to me, no one can compare\n[02:08.94] Your moans\n[02:09.62] carry through the midnight air\n[02:11.74] Feeling detached from myself, yeah, I'm so scared\n[02:14.58] So imagine how it feels when you're not there\n[02:17.66] I ain't gonna fuck it up, I ain't gonna\n[02:19.62] You ain't ever did me wrong\n[02:20.96] I need your love, I don't want it\n[02:22.50] Lately, we been takin' way too many drugs, I don't condone it\n[02:25.34] Let's just take each other's hearts like property and fuckin' own it (Yeah)\n[Chorus]\n[02:28.94] Late night, with the boys in a foreign (Skrrt, skrrt)\n[02:31.78] Pick the hoes up and kick 'em out in the mornin' (Yes, sir)\n[02:34.56] Uh, even brought a ho home for my girlfriend (Yes, sir)\n[02:37.32] She gave us both sloppy top, it was amazin' (Ugh, yeah-yeah)\n[02:40.34] Pray to God, used to conversate with Satan (Uh, oh)\n[02:43.02] Lost in confusion, I'll show you what a maze is (Oh, oh)\n[02:45.72] My mind is a palace, don't got the blueprints (Oh-oh)\n[02:48.74] Told them demons I got a new phone, uh, who is this? (Oh)\n[Outro]\n[02:59.72] Oh\n[02:59.96] Who this? Who this? (Oh)\n[03:03.92] Who this? Who this? (Soul)\n[03:07.44] Who this? Who this? (Soul)\n[03:12.44] Stupid, foolish (I know)\n[03:16.88] Who this? Who this? (Soul)\n[03:24.60] Who this? Who this? (Soul)\n